text:
No license shall be issued by the city for the conducting of any of the businesses enumerated in this section until approval has first been obtained from the city council granting the applicant the right to so conduct such businesses; such businesses requiring city council approval shall be as follows:
1\. Amusement concessions;
2\. Boardinghouses;
3\. Bowling alleys;
4\. Cabarets;
5\. Carnivals;
6\. Circuses;
7\. Dog kennels;
8\. Exhibitions;
9\. Fairs;
10\. Lodginghouses;
11\. Pool halls;
12\. Public dances and public dancehalls;
13\. Secondhand dealers or collectors;
14\. Shooting galleries and rifle ranges;
15\. Skating rinks;
16\. Theaters;
17\. Public baths;
18\. Any other business similar in nature which might be dangerous to or affect the public morals, health, peace or safety or be dangerous to surrounding property.
